	(text "TODO: USB VBUS Detection & D+ Pull-up\n\nSTM32F103C8 USB Full Speed (self-powered / bus-powered).\n\n- PA9 - detect VBUS via 33k/47k voltage divider.\n- PA10 - control D+ pull-up via 1.5kΩ resistor.\n- On startup, configure PA10 as Hi-Z.\n- When VBUS is detected, initialize USB and drive PA10 HIGH.\n- When VBUS is lost, set PA10 to Hi-Z and stop USB.\n- Support USB reconnection without MCU reset.\n\nNote: USART1 is remapped to PB6/PB7."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 351.282 61.722 0)
		(effects
