	(text_box "Power Path Management\n\nTPS2113A selects between +5V_EXT (from the 12 V DC/DC converter) and USB VBUS. External power has priority; USB is used when external power is absent. Reverse-current blocking prevents backfeeding between sources. The output +5V_SYS supplies the 5 V loads and the 3.3 V regulator."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 139.7 120.65 0)
